# @unerp/* resolve from the self-hosted UniERP registry (unierp-infra/registry).
# § 4.2: after the split the layer boundaries are published artifacts.
# Scoped rather than global so the thousands of third-party packages still come
# straight from npmjs — proxying them through a local cache adds failure modes
# for no benefit, and § 10's dependency-confusion defence only requires that OUR
# scope be served exclusively by our registry.
@unerp:registry=http://localhost:4873/
